frontend_architecture.api_client:
Singleton Axios instance. ALL components import from this file.
baseURL: VITE_API_URL/api (e.g. http://localhost:5000/api)

REQUEST INTERCEPTOR:
  Reads token from localStorage 'auth-storage' → path: state.token
  Attaches as: Authorization: Bearer {token}

RESPONSE INTERCEPTOR:
  On 401 → remove 'auth-storage' from localStorage → hard redirect to /login

USAGE:
  import api from '@/lib/api';
  const res = await api.get('/projects', { params: { page: 1, limit: 10 } });
  const res = await api.post('/tasks', payload);
  const res = await api.put('/tasks/:id', payload);
  const res = await api.delete('/tasks/:id');

frontend_architecture.hooks:
useToast()  — src/hooks/use-toast.js
  Returns: { toast }
  Usage: toast({ title: "...", description: "...", variant: "default"|"destructive" })

frontend_architecture.how_to_add_new_page:
1. Create: src/pages/YourPage.jsx
   Required imports:
     import api from '@/lib/api';
     import { useAuthStore } from '@/store/authStore';
     import { useHeaderStore } from '@/store/headerStore';
     import { useToast } from '@/hooks/use-toast';

2. Call setHeader in useEffect:
     const { setHeader } = useHeaderStore();
     useEffect(() => { setHeader("Page Title", "Subtitle"); }, [setHeader]);

3. Add route to src/App.jsx inside the Layout route:
     import YourPage from './pages/YourPage';
     ...
     <Route path="your-path" element={<YourPage />} />

4. Add sidebar item to src/components/Layout.jsx with role restriction.

5. For paginated data use TablePagination:
     import TablePagination from '@/components/ui/table-pagination';
     <TablePagination page={page} totalPages={totalPages} pageSize={pageSize}
       totalItems={totalItems} onPageChange={setPage} onPageSizeChange={setPageSize} />

6. For role-based UI:
     const { user } = useAuthStore();
     if (user?.role === 'ADMIN') { ... }

7. For error/success messages:
     const { toast } = useToast();
     toast({ title: "Success", description: "Done!" });
     toast({ title: "Error", description: "msg", variant: "destructive" });
